*.jpg filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# Only *.jpg is in LFS here; every other binary is tracked plain, and that is
# deliberate. (The Pages build does resolve LFS fine, verified 2026-08-03: a
# tracked jpg serves its real bytes live. The split is historical, not a
# constraint.) These files are small, so leave them plain and just mark them
# binary (-diff -merge -text): without it git classifies a PDF as text and
# core.autocrlf=input is free to rewrite bytes on commit.
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ogg binary
*.mp3 binary
